      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Not necessarily a bug imo. World occlusion culling also does this. Transparent materials are also vulnerable to stacked transparency (\"magnifying glasses\") with the same render queue.\n\nThe concern described in OP doesn't affect every avatar, but mostly some unoptimized avatars.",
